  "CharSel/TexCharSelText": {
   "comment": "Character profiles: each block keeps its region; blocks 18-21, 22-23, 24-25 and 26-27 continue one another in that order.",
   "patches": [
    {
     "ja": "まだ麻雀をよく分かっていませんが、一生懸命アガリを目指します。",
     "lines": [
      "Still learning the",
      "game, but tries",
      "hard to win",
      "every hand."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      0,
      0,
      108,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 104,
     "at": [
      3,
      2
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "鳴ける牌があればどんなものでも食いつきます。アガリはそのあと。",
     "lines": [
      "Pounces on any tile",
      "that can be called.",
      "Worries about",
      "winning later."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      0,
      64,
      108,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 104,
     "at": [
      3,
      66
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "テンパイをするとすぐさまリーチ。裏ドラに期待を懸けます。",
     "lines": [
      "Calls riichi as soon",
      "as in tenpai, and",
      "hopes for ura dora",
      "to boost the hand."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      0,
      128,
      108,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 104,
     "at": [
      3,
      130
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "持ち前のスピードを麻雀でも発揮します。安くてもお構いなし。",
     "lines": [
      "Brings that famous",
      "speed to the table.",
      "Doesn't mind if the",
      "hand is cheap."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      0,
      192,
      108,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 104,
     "at": [
      3,
      194
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "自分のペースに持ち込んでの、するどいリーチが得意です。",
     "lines": [
      "Takes control of",
      "the game's pace,",
      "then strikes with",
      "a sharp riichi."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      108,
      176,
      107,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      111,
      178
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "攻めるときは攻める。守るときは守る。堅実なプレイをします。",
     "lines": [
      "A steady player:",
      "attacks when it's",
      "time to attack, and",
      "defends otherwise."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      108,
      0,
      107,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      111,
      2
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "チートイツからいろいろな形に展開させます。",
     "lines": [
      "Starts from Seven",
      "Pairs and branches",
      "into other hands."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      108,
      64,
      107,
      48
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      111,
      66
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "(blank)",
     "lines": [
      ""
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      108,
      112,
      54,
      16
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 50
    },
    {
     "ja": "まわりの状況を考えて、攻めの形を自在に変化させま",
     "lines": [
      "Reads the table and",
      "freely reshapes the",
      "hand to attack."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      108,
      128,
      107,
      48
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      111,
      130
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "す。",
     "lines": [
      ""
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      163,
      111,
      53,
      16
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 49
    },
    {
     "ja": "とにかく振り込まない堅実な打ち方。めったにリーチもかけません。",
     "lines": [
      "Plays it safe and",
      "almost never deals",
      "in. Rarely even",
      "calls riichi."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      215,
      0,
      107,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      218,
      2
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "力強いプレイで、破壊力バツグンの手役を狙います。",
     "lines": [
      "Plays with power,",
      "going after hands",
      "that hit hard."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      215,
      64,
      107,
      48
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      218,
      66
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "かわいい見かけとは裏腹に、素早い手作りで場を圧倒します。",
     "lines": [
      "Looks cute, but",
      "builds hands fast",
      "enough to take over",
      "the whole table."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      215,
      112,
      107,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      218,
      114
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "つねにアガリを狙いますが、守りも得意な万能スタイル。",
     "lines": [
      "Always goes for the",
      "win, yet defends",
      "well too. A true",
      "all-rounder."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      215,
      176,
      107,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      218,
      178
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "豪快な打ち方から繰り出される手牌もまた迫力満点。",
     "lines": [
      "A bold, flashy style",
      "that produces hands",
      "just as bold."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      322,
      0,
      107,
      48
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      325,
      2
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "きっちり場の状況を見てアガリにつなげる技術はバツグン。",
     "lines": [
      "Carefully reads",
      "the table and is",
      "superb at turning",
      "it into a win."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      322,
      48,
      107,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      325,
      50
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "ソツのない麻雀をしますが、ときおり見せる一撃は強力。",
     "lines": [
      "Plays a tidy game",
      "without mistakes,",
      "but now and then",
      "lands a big hit."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      322,
      128,
      107,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      325,
      130
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "豪快な性格で、パワフルな一色系を目指します。",
     "lines": [
      "Big and bold.",
      "Goes for",
      "powerful flush",
      "hands."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      429,
      0,
      83,
      64
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 79,
     "at": [
      432,
      2
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "意地悪な捨て牌や",
     "lines": [
      "A contrarian who"
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      322,
      192,
      107,
      16
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      325,
      194
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "待ち牌で",
     "lines": [
      "confuses rivals"
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      429,
      192,
      83,
      16
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 79,
     "at": [
      432,
      194
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "相手を惑わせる",
     "lines": [
      "with sneaky discards"
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      322,
      208,
      107,
      16
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      325,
      210
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "ひねくれ者。",
     "lines": [
      "and waits."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      429,
      208,
      83,
      16
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 79,
     "at": [
      432,
      210
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "得意のリーチからのツモは驚異的。",
     "lines": [
      "Riichi, then tsumo:",
      "deadly every time."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      322,
      224,
      107,
      32
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      325,
      226
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "運を味方にプレイします。",
     "lines": [
      "Plays with luck",
      "on their side."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      429,
      224,
      83,
      32
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 79,
     "at": [
      432,
      226
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "同じ絵柄を集める",
     "lines": [
      "Loves collecting"
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      215,
      240,
      107,
      16
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      218,
      242
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "のが得意で、チーよりもポンが好き。",
     "lines": [
      "matching tiles,",
      "and likes Pon",
      "more than Chii."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      429,
      64,
      83,
      48
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 79,
     "at": [
      432,
      66
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "目に見えるもの",
     "lines": [
      "Believes only in what"
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      322,
      112,
      107,
      16
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 103,
     "at": [
      325,
      114
     ]
    },
    {
     "ja": "だけを信じて、完璧な麻雀を心がけます。",
     "lines": [
      "can be seen.",
      "Aims for",
      "perfect play."
     ],
     "style": "profile",
     "line_height": 16,
     "rect": [
      429,
      112,
      83,
      48
     ],
     "clear": 0,
     "max_width": 79,
